ONT-FAMILY: Arial\"><span style=\"FONT-SIZE: 12pt; FONT-FAMILY: Arial\"><strong><span>&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp; (공지사항으로 알림)</span></strong></span></span></span></span></span></font></p><p style=\"LINE-HEIGHT: 1.5\"><font color=\"#0900ff\"><span style=\"FONT-SIZE: 12pt; FONT-FAMILY: Arial\"><span style=\"FONT-SIZE: 12pt; FONT-FAMILY: Arial\"><span><span style=\"FONT-SIZE: 12pt; FONT-FAMILY: Arial\"><span style=\"FONT-SIZE: 12pt; FONT-FAMILY: Arial\"><span><span style=\"FONT-SIZE: 12pt; FONT-FAMILY: Arial\"><span style=\"FONT-SIZE: 12pt; FONT-FAMILY: Arial\"><strong><span>★&nbsp;시간이 촉박한 점 양해 부탁드립니다.</span></strong></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></font></p><p style=\"LINE-HEIGHT: 1.5\"><font color=\"#0900ff\"><span style=\"FONT-SIZE: 12pt; FONT-FAMILY: Arial\"><span style=\"FONT-SIZE: 12pt; FONT-FAMILY: Arial\"><span><span style=\"FONT-SIZE: 12pt; FONT-FAMILY: Arial\"><span style=\"FONT-SIZE: 12pt; FONT-FAMILY: Arial\"><span><span style=\"FONT-SIZE: 12pt; FONT-FAMILY: Arial\"><span style=\"FONT-SIZE: 12pt; FONT-FAMILY: Arial\"><strong></strong></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></font><font color=\"#0900ff\"><span style=\"FONT-SIZE: 12pt; FONT-FAMILY: Arial\"><span style=\"FONT-SIZE: 12pt; FONT-FAMILY: Arial\"><span><span style=\"FONT-SIZE: 12pt; FONT-FAMILY: Arial\"><span style=\"FONT-SIZE: 12pt; FONT-FAMILY: Arial\"><span>&nbsp;</span></span></span></span></span></span></font></p><div style=\"HEIGHT: 15px; WIDTH: 99%; BACKGROUND: url(http://www.kumoh.ac.kr/webeditor/images/deco/line06.gif?rv=1.0.1) repeat-x left 50%\"><hr style=\"BORDER-TOP: black 0px; BORDER-RIGHT: black 0px; BORDER-BOTTOM: black 0px; POSITION: relative; LEFT: -999px; BORDER-LEFT: black 0px; TOP: -999px\"></div><p style=\"LINE-HEIGHT: 1.5\"><font color=\"#0900ff\"><span style=\"FONT-SIZE: 12pt; FONT-FAMILY: Arial\"><span style=\"FONT-SIZE: 12pt; FONT-FAMILY: Arial\"><span><span style=\"FONT-SIZE: 12pt; FONT-FAMILY: Arial\"><span style=\"FONT-SIZE: 12pt; FONT-FAMILY: Arial\"><strong></strong></span></span></span></span></span></font>&nbsp;</p><p style=\"LINE-HEIGHT: 1.5\"><font color=\"#000000\"><span style=\"FONT-FAMILY: Arial\"><span style=\"FONT-SIZE: 12pt\">2018학년도 1학기 방학 중 부서별 근로장학생을 모집하오니 희망하는 학생은 기간 내에 신청하시기 바랍니다.</span></span><br><span style=\"FONT-SIZE: 11pt; FONT-FAMILY: Arial\">- 신청자 전체 명단이 각 부서에 통보되므로 근로장학생 선발은 선착순이 아닙니다.-</span><br><span style=\"FONT-SIZE: 11pt; FONT-FAMILY: Arial\">&nbsp; </span><br></font><font color=\"#000000\"><font style=\"BACKGROUND-COLOR: #ffd9ec\"><span style=\"FONT-SIZE: 11pt; FONT-FAMILY: Arial\"><strong><span style=\"FONT-SIZE: 12pt\">Ⅰ. 국가근로장학생</span></strong></span><br></font><span style=\"FONT-SIZE: 11pt\"><span style=\"FONT-FAMILY: Arial\">1. 자격요건&nbsp;</span></span><br><span style=\"FONT-SIZE: 11pt; FONT-FAMILY: Arial\">&nbsp;가. 2018-1학기 재학생 중 한국장학재단 국가 교육근로장학사업&nbsp;신청자 중 순위 통과자</span><br><span style=\"FONT-SIZE: 11pt; FONT-FAMILY: Arial\">&nbsp;※ 순위확인 방법 :&nbsp;</span></font><font color=\"#000000\"><span style=\"FONT-FAMILY: Arial\"><span style=\"FONT-SIZE: 11pt\">한국장학재단에서 확인</span></span></font></p><p style=\"LINE-HEIGHT: 1.5\"><font color=\"#000000\"><span style=\"FONT-FAMILY: Arial\"><span style=\"FONT-SIZE: 11pt\"><font color=\"#000000\"><span style=\"FONT-FAMILY: Arial\"><span style=\"FONT-SIZE: 11pt\">&nbsp;(신청기간 중에는 원스톱서비스 로그인→학생지원→근로장학생 신청서 제출에서도 확인 가능)<font color=\"#000000\"><br><span style=\"FONT-SIZE: 11pt; FONT-FAMILY: Arial\">&nbsp;나. 정규학기 내 재학생 (휴학생, 초과학기자 제외)</span><br><span style=\"FONT-SIZE: 11pt; FONT-FAMILY: Arial\">&nbsp;다. 소득 정보 확인 : 8분위 이하</span><br><span style=\"FONT-SIZE: 11pt; FONT-FAMILY: Arial\">&nbsp;라. 직전학기 성적 70점/100점 만점(평점 1.6) 이상</span></font></span></span></font></span></span></font></p><span style=\"FONT-SIZE: 11pt; FONT-FAMILY: Arial\"><p style=\"LINE-HEIGHT: 1.5\">&nbsp;</p></span><p style=\"LINE-HEIGHT: 1.5\"><font color=\"#000000\"><span style=\"FONT-FAMILY: Arial\"><span style=\"FONT-SIZE: 11pt\"><span style=\"FONT-FAMILY: Arial\"><span style=\"FONT-SIZE: 11pt\">2. 신청기간 : 6.4.(월) 10:00 ~ 6.7.(목) 18:00 까지</span></span></span></span><br><span style=\"FONT-SIZE: 11pt; FONT-FAMILY: Arial\">&nbsp;</span><br><span style=\"FONT-SIZE: 11pt; FONT-FAMILY: Arial\">3. 근로기간 : 2018.6.22.(금)~8.31.(금) [방학 중]</span></font></p><span style=\"FONT-SIZE: 11pt; FONT-FAMILY: Arial\"><p style=\"LINE-HEIGHT: 1.5\">&nbsp;</p></span><p style=\"LINE-HEIGHT: 1.5\"><font color=\"#000000\"><span style=\"FONT-FAMILY: Arial\"><span style=\"FONT-SIZE: 11pt\"><span style=\"FONT-FAMILY: Arial\"><span style=\"FONT-SIZE: 11pt\">4. 부서 신청방법</span></span></span></span><br><span style=\"FONT-SIZE: 11pt; FONT-FAMILY: Arial\">&nbsp;가. 원스톱서비스 로그인&nbsp;- 학생지원 - 근로장학생 신청서 제출 - </span></font></p><p style=\"LINE-HEIGHT: 1.5\"><font color=\"#000000\"><span style=\"FONT-FAMILY: Arial\"><span style=\"FONT-SIZE: 11pt\">&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp; 신청 상세내역작성( 계좌등록, 근무부서, 희망 부서 및 희망근무시간 입력) - </span></span></font></p><p style=\"LINE-HEIGHT: 1.5\"><font color=\"#000000\"><span style=\"FONT-FAMILY: Arial\"><span style=\"FONT-SIZE: 11pt\">&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp; 신청버튼 클릭 - 완료</span></span><br><span style=\"FONT-SIZE: 11pt; FONT-FAMILY: Arial\">&nbsp;나. 국가근로 우선선발순위: <span style=\"FONT-SIZE: 11pt; FONT-FAMILY: Arial\"><font style=\"FONT-FAMILY: null; BACKGROUND-COLOR: #e4f7ba\">“1순위(소득 4분위 이하)&gt; 2순위(5~6분위)&gt; 3순위(7~8분위)”</font></span><br></span></font></p><p style=\"LINE-HEIGHT: 1.5\"><font color=\"#000000\"><span style=\"FONT-SIZE: 11pt; FONT-FAMILY: Arial\">&nbsp;&nbsp; </span><span style=\"FONT-SIZE: 11pt; FONT-FAMILY: Arial\">1) 1순위 : 국가근로 신청가능</span><br><span style=\"FONT-SIZE: 11pt; FONT-FAMILY: Arial\">&nbsp;&nbsp; 2) 2순위, 3순위 : 국가근로 신청가능하나, 1순위자가 근로배정인원보다 적은 경우 등 부득이한 경우 </span></font></p><p style=\"LINE-HEIGHT: 1.5\"><font color=\"#000000\"><span style=\"FONT-SIZE: 11pt; FONT-FAMILY: Arial\">&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp; 2순위→3순위 순으로 근로선발 가능</span><br><span style=\"FONT-SIZE: 11pt; FONT-FAMILY: Arial\">&nbsp;&nbsp; 3) 순위 외 : 국가근로 선발순위 없음, 국가근로 신청불가<font style=\"FONT-FAMILY: null\" color=\"#000000\"><br><span style=\"FONT-SIZE: 11pt; FONT-FAMILY: Arial\">&nbsp;다. 근무부서, 희망근무장소 : 붙임 참고 (반드시 파일확인 후 신청하세요)</span><br><span style=\"FONT-SIZE: 11pt; FONT-FAMILY: Arial\">&nbsp;라. 희망근무시간(가능한 시간 모두 기재)</span><br><span style=\"FONT-SIZE: 11pt; FONT-FAMILY: Arial\">&nbsp;&nbsp; 1) 시간 입력시 시간단위는 24시간으로 기재(오후 3시일 경우 → 15시로 입력)</span><br><span style=\"FONT-SIZE: 11pt; FONT-FAMILY: Arial\">&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp; ex) 월:13:00~15:00/ 화:11:00~12:00, 15:00~17:00/ 수:14:00~18:00/ 목: 없음/ 금: 9:00~13:00</span><br><span style=\"FONT-SIZE: 11pt; FONT-FAMILY: Arial\">&nbsp;&nbsp; 2) 반드시 수업시간을 제외한 근로가능시간을 입력해야 함</span><br><span style=\"FONT-SIZE: 11pt; FONT-FAMILY: Arial\">&nbsp;마. 모두 입력 후 신청버튼 클릭~! 별도 제출서류 없음</span></font></span></font></p><span style=\"FONT-SIZE: 11pt; FONT-FAMILY: Arial\"><p style=\"LINE-HEIGHT: 1.5\">&nbsp;</p></span><p style=\"LINE-HEIGHT: 1.5\"><font color=\"#000000\"><span style=\"FONT-FAMILY: Arial\"><span style=\"FONT-SIZE: 11pt\"><span style=\"FONT-FAMILY: Arial\"><span style=\"FONT-SIZE: 11pt\">5. 선발일정</span></span></span></span><br><span style=\"FONT-SIZE: 11pt; FONT-FAMILY: Arial\">&nbsp;가. 학생 : 희망근무부서 신청[6.4.(월)~6.7.(목)18:00 까지]</span><br><span style=\"FONT-SIZE: 11pt; FONT-FAMILY: Arial\">&nbsp;나. 각 해당부서 : 각 부서에서 희망근무부서 신청자 명단을 확인하여 해당 학생에게 연락 확인 후 추천</span><br><span style=\"FONT-SIZE: 11pt; FONT-FAMILY: Arial\">&nbsp;다. 학생처 : 근로장학생 선발확정(예정) : 6.18.(월) 이후</span></font></p><p style=\"LINE-HEIGHT: 1.5\">&nbsp;</p><p style=\"LINE-HEIGHT: 1.5\"><font color=\"#000000\"><span style=\"FONT-FAMILY: Arial\"><span style=\"FONT-SIZE: 11pt\">6. 근로장학금액 : 근로 다음달 10일 지급(10일이 주말일 경우 금요일에 지급)</span></span><br><span style=\"FONT-SIZE: 11pt; FONT-FAMILY: Arial\">&nbsp;가. 교내일반 : 시간당 급여 8.000원</span><br><span style=\"FONT-SIZE: 11pt; FONT-FAMILY: Arial\">&nbsp;나. 교외일반 : 시간당 급여 9,500원</span></font></p><p style=\"LINE-HEIGHT: 1.5\">&nbsp;</p><p style=\"LINE-HEIGHT: 1.5\">&nbsp;</p><div style=\"HEIGHT: 15px; WIDTH: 99%; BACKGROUND: url(http://www.kumoh.ac.kr/webeditor/images/deco/line05.gif?rv=1.0.1) repeat-x left 50%\"><hr style=\"BORDER-TOP: black 0px; BORDER-RIGHT: black 0px; BORDER-BOTTOM: black 0px; POSITION: relative; LEFT: -999px; BORDER-LEFT: black 0px; TOP: -999px\"></div><p>&nbsp;</p><p style=\"LINE-HEIGHT: 1.5\">&nbsp;</p><p style=\"LINE-HEIGHT: 1.5\"><font color=\"#000000\"><font style=\"BACKGROUND-COLOR: #ffd9ec\"><span style=\"FONT-FAMILY: Arial\"><span style=\"FONT-SIZE: 11pt\"><strong><span style=\"FONT-SIZE: 12pt\">Ⅱ. 대학근로장학생 </span></strong></span></span><br></font><span style=\"FONT-SIZE: 11pt; FONT-FAMILY: Arial\">1. 자격요건</span></font></p><p style=\"LINE-HEIGHT: 1.5\"><font color=\"#000000\"><span style=\"FONT-SIZE: 11pt; FONT-FAMILY: Arial\">&nbsp;가. 2018-1학기 재학생 중 직전학기 성적 70점/100점 만점(평점 1.6) 이상</span></font></p><p style=\"LINE-HEIGHT: 1.5\"><font color=\"#000000\"><span style=\"FONT-SIZE: 11pt; FONT-FAMILY: Arial\"><font color=\"#000000\"><span style=\"FONT-SIZE: 11pt; FONT-FAMILY: Arial\"><span style=\"FONT-SIZE: 11pt; FONT-FAMILY: Arial\">&nbsp;나. 정규학기 내 재학생 (휴학생, 초과학기자 제외)</span></span></font></span></font></p><p style=\"LINE-HEIGHT: 1.5\">&nbsp;</p><p style=\"LINE-HEIGHT: 1.5\"><span style=\"FONT-FAMILY: Arial\"><span style=\"FONT-SIZE: 11pt\"><font color=\"#000000\">2. 신청기간 : 6.4.(월) 10:00 ~ 6.7.(목) 18:00 까지</font></span></span></p><p style=\"LINE-HEIGHT: 1.5\">&nbsp;</p><p style=\"LINE-HEIGHT: 1.5\"><span style=\"FONT-FAMILY: Arial\"><span style=\"FONT-SIZE: 11pt\"><font color=\"#000000\">3. 근로기간 : 2018.6.22.(금)~8.31.(금) [방학 중]<span style=\"FONT-FAMILY: Arial\"><span style=\"FONT-SIZE: 11pt\">&nbsp;</span></span></font></span></span></p><p style=\"LINE-HEIGHT: 1.5\">&nbsp;</p><p style=\"LINE-HEIGHT: 1.5\"><font color=\"#000000\"><span style=\"FONT-FAMILY: Arial\"><span style=\"FONT-SIZE: 11pt\">4. 대학근로 운영부서 :</span></span><span style=\"FONT-SIZE: 11pt; FONT-FAMILY: Arial\">&nbsp;학생식당 00명→ 문의 054-478-7049</span></font></p><p style=\"LINE-HEIGHT: 1.5\">&nbsp;</p><p style=\"LINE-HEIGHT: 1.5\"><font color=\"#000000\"><span style=\"FONT-FAMILY: Arial\"><span style=\"FONT-SIZE: 11pt\">5. 부서 신청방법</span></span><br><span style=\"FONT-SIZE: 11pt; FONT-FAMILY: Arial\">&nbsp;가. 희망부서 문의 [직접방문 또는 전화] → 희망부서 온라인 신청 [근무부서와 협의 완료 후 신청]</span></font></p><p style=\"LINE-HEIGHT: 1.5\"><font color=\"#000000\"><span style=\"FONT-SIZE: 11pt; FONT-FAMILY: Arial\">&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp; → 근로장학생 선발 확정&nbsp;</span><br><span style=\"FONT-SIZE: 11pt; FONT-FAMILY: Arial\">&nbsp;나. 온라인 신청방법 : 원스톱서비스 로그인 - 학생지원 - 근로장학생 신청서 제출</span></font></p><p style=\"LINE-HEIGHT: 1.5\"><font color=\"#000000\"><span style=\"FONT-SIZE: 11pt; FONT-FAMILY: Arial\">&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;- 신청 상세내역작성(계좌등록, 근무부서, 희망 부서 및 희망근무시간 입력) </span></font></p><p style=\"LINE-HEIGHT: 1.5\"><font color=\"#000000\"><span style=\"FONT-SIZE: 11pt; FONT-FAMILY: Arial\">&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp; - 신청버튼 클릭 - 완료</span></font></p><p style=\"LINE-HEIGHT: 1.5\">&nbsp;</p><p style=\"LINE-HEIGHT: 1.5\"><font color=\"#000000\"><span style=\"FONT-FAMILY: Arial\"><span style=\"FONT-SIZE: 11pt\">6. 선발일정</span></span><br><span style=\"FONT-SIZE: 11pt; FONT-FAMILY: Arial\">&nbsp;가. 학생 : 희망근무부서 신청[6.4.(월)~6.7.(목)18:00 까지]</span><br><span style=\"FONT-SIZE: 11pt; FONT-FAMILY: Arial\">&nbsp;나. 각 해당부서 : 각 부서에서 희망근무부서 신청자 명단 확인하여 해당 학생에게 연락 확인 후 추천</span><br><span style=\"FONT-SIZE: 11pt; FONT-FAMILY: Arial\">&nbsp;다. 학생처 : 근로장학생 선발확정(예정) : 6.18.(월) 이후</span></font></p><p style=\"LINE-HEIGHT: 1.5\">&nbsp;</p><p style=\"LINE-HEIGHT: 1.5\"><font color=\"#000000\"><span style=\"FONT-FAMILY: Arial\"><span style=\"FONT-SIZE: 11pt\">7. 근로장학금액 : 근로 다음달 10일 지급(10일이 주말일 경우 금요일에 지급)</span></span><br><span style=\"FONT-SIZE: 11pt; FONT-FAMILY: Arial\">&nbsp;가. 일반근로 : 시간당 급여 7,530원</span><br><span style=\"FONT-SIZE: 11pt; FONT-FAMILY: Arial\">&nbsp;나. 육체근로(식당) : 시간당 급여 8,000원&nbsp; </span></font></p><p style=\"LINE-HEIGHT: 1.5\"><span style=\"FONT-FAMILY: Arial\"><span style=\"FONT-SIZE: 11pt\"></span></span></p><p style=\"LINE-HEIGHT: 1.5\">&nbsp;</p><p style=\"LINE-HEIGHT: 1.5\"><font color=\"#000000\"><span style=\"FONT-FAMILY: Arial\"><span style=\"FONT-SIZE: 11pt\"><font style=\"BACKGROUND-COLOR: #ffd9ec\"><span style=\"FONT-SIZE: 12pt\"><strong>Ⅲ. 유의사항</strong></span></font></span></span><br></font></p><p style=\"LINE-HEIGHT: 1.5\"><font color=\"#000000\"><span style=\"FONT-SIZE: 11pt; FONT-FAMILY: Arial\">1. 학적변동자(휴학, 제적, 졸업 등) 신청 불가[근로장학금 지급 불가]</span><br><span style=\"FONT-SIZE: 11pt; FONT-FAMILY: Arial\">2. 근로시간은 근무부서에 따라 다름</span><br><span style=\"FONT-SIZE: 11pt\"><span style=\"FONT-FAMILY: Arial\">3. 수업시간과 근로시간 중복불가 </span></span></font></p><p style=\"LINE-HEIGHT: 1.5\">&nbsp;</p><p style=\"LINE-HEIGHT: 1.5\"><span style=\"FONT-FAMILY: Arial\"><span style=\"FONT-SIZE: 11pt\"><font color=\"#000000\">붙임 2018-1학기 방학중 부서별 근로시간 배정표 1부.</font></span></span></p><p style=\"LINE-HEIGHT: 1.5\">&nbsp;</p><p style=\"LINE-HEIGHT: 1.5\">&nbsp;</p><p style=\"LINE-HEIGHT: 1.5\">&nbsp;</p><p style=\"TEXT-ALIGN: center; LINE-HEIGHT: 1.5\"><span style=\"FONT-FAMILY: Arial\"><span style=\"FONT-SIZE: 11pt\"><font color=\"#000000\">2018.&nbsp;&nbsp; 5.</font></span></span></p><p style=\"TEXT-ALIGN: center; LINE-HEIGHT: 1.5\"><font color=\"#000000\"><span style=\"FONT-FAMILY: Arial\"><span style=\"FONT-SIZE: 18pt\">&nbsp; </span></span><br><span style=\"FONT-SIZE: 18pt; FONT-FAMILY: Arial\">학생처</span></font></p><p>&nbsp;</p><p>